    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry, based Czech Republic (Prague), operating since 2014. Develops retail and custom typefaces; library 30+ fonts incl. widely-used Avantt, Roobert and Greed, plus custom work (SCA Sans, Jidu, Mecherle) for design/fashion/cultural clients. Also runs Offline merch/specimen platform. Small specialised foundry with in-house staff plus external collaborators; established and well-regarded in contemporary type. Work Status Studio (it is the org itself). Autonomy 4 (inferred): runs its own retail line and delivers custom commissions independently.",
